# Local file storage root.
#
# Guest photos, identification documents, room images, expense receipts,
# maintenance and housekeeping photos and the property logo are written here by
# LocalFileStorage, under:
#
#     uploads/{propertyId}/{entityType}/{yyyy}/{MM}/{uuid}.{ext}
#
# Everything except this file is git-ignored. Cloud object storage is a future
# roadmap item; see ../../docs/future-deployment-roadmap.md.
